{"body":"## Summary\n\n- write the Formal AI Codex provider, model, and model catalog settings to the isolated `.codex/config.toml`\n- leave caller-owned post-`exec` `-c` overrides intact without mixing wrapper provider settings into argv\n- add a focused regression, update shared wrapper/traceability fixtures, and preserve the investigation evidence\n- document the Codex `-c` placement pitfall in the README so hand-written invocations do not hit the same fallback\n\n## Reproduction\n\nCodex CLI 0.146.0 drops wrapper-owned global `-c` settings when a caller adds `-c` settings after `exec`. The regression test uses the reported `model_reasoning_effort=none` and `model_reasoning_summary=auto` arguments and proves that the old seed placed both override groups on argv with no config file.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo test` — full suite passed; main unit target: 2,407 passed, 3 ignored\n- `cargo test --test issue_902 -- --nocapture`\n- `cargo test --test integration with_formal_ai -- --nocapture` — 17 passed\n- `cargo fmt --check`\n- `cargo clippy --lib --bins --tests --all-features`\n- `cargo check --examples --all-features`\n- file-size, hardcoded-language, changelog, and total-closure checks\n- real `codex-cli 0.146.0` run reached `http://127.0.0.1:8793/api/openai/v1/responses`, selected provider `formal-ai server`, and completed on the first attempt\n\nThe full case study and raw logs are in `docs/case-studies/issue-902/README.md`.\n\nFixes #902\n","createdAt":"2026-08-03T10:22:33Z","headRefName":"issue-902-a9a86f6c368f","mergedAt":"2026-08-03T16:02:52Z","number":913,"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-03T15:42:28Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/30828201296/job/91735315000","name":"Build formal-ai","startedAt":"2026-08-03T15:35:57Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Agentic CLI Matrix"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-03T15:37:06Z","c